# Keep bytes stable across Windows/macOS/Linux: the app's "Guardar en carpeta"
# writes these files and the tests compare them byte-for-byte.
* text=auto eol=lf
# The store database stays CRLF + BOM so Excel opens it cleanly.
*.csv text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pptx binary
*.xlsx binary
